<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the StrRef (string ID) of the localized name of the plot entry. <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetStringByStringId" title="GetStringByStringId">GetStringByStringId</a> or <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GetTlkTableString" title="GetTlkTableString">GetTlkTableString</a> can be used to obtain the actual name from the StrRef.
</p>
